{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a PRO:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>P</strong>ick - decide which racer you think has the highest chances of winning</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>R</strong>ace - the cards are drawn, the charms are triggered, but there can only be one winner! (unless there is a tie... then there can be more than one)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>O</strong>ptimize - modify, add and remove cards, get rules bending charms for the racers and yourself and win all the trophies to be the best Stable Keeper!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bookie is a fast paced deckbuilder roguelite game in which your task is to draft cards associated with each racer and manipulate the odds to your advantage. Choose the correct winner of the race and earn coins that you can spend to further upgrade the stable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To get a trophy you must first complete a series of races, and then finally pick the correct winner for the final race in the series. Choose wrongly and it's game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect all trophies in the Championship to become the Ultimate Stable Keeper!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3735080?t=1754279762","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3735080?t=1754279762","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735080/7dc9243377fa0c3aa407cd2c3a98099b4c9468fe/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754279762","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735080/7dc9243377fa0c3aa407cd2c3a98099b4c9468fe/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754279762","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3828390,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a PRO:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>P</strong>ick - decide which racer you think has the highest chances of winning</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>R</strong>ace - the cards are drawn, the charms are triggered, but there can only be one winner! (unless there is a tie... then there can be more than one)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>O</strong>ptimize - modify, add and remove cards, get rules bending charms for the racers and yourself and win all the trophies to be the best Stable Keeper!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bookie is a fast paced deckbuilder roguelite game in which your task is to draft cards associated with each racer and manipulate the odds to your advantage. Choose the correct winner of the race and earn coins that you can spend to further upgrade the stable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To get a trophy you must first complete a series of races, and then finally pick the correct winner for the final race in the series. Choose wrongly and it's game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect all trophies in the Championship to become the Ultimate Stable Keeper!</p>","developers":["Rainier Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735080/7561b5274aec7cbf1300de0398ee772a94a906e5/header.jpg?t=1754279762","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.s